---
description: Editorial standards for SEO blog posts written or edited with seodraft. Apply when drafting, editing, or reviewing blog content.
alwaysApply: false
---

When writing or editing blog content with seodraft:

- Run seodraft's quality gate before calling a draft done, and fix every failing rule.
- Use only facts the owner supplied or seodraft returned. No invented statistics, customers, quotes, or sources.
- One primary keyword per post. Check for cannibalization with existing posts before starting a new one.
- No filler intros, no "in today's fast-paced world", no summaries that repeat the post.
- Never promise rankings or traffic.
- Never deliver or approve a post without the owner's explicit OK.
